From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t7001-air2: Enable the GPU

Turn the A8X GPU on for the iPad Air 2 (J81, J82). DWI is already held
on so the core ID can be read. Firmware boot of the G4G image is a
later step.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: ricktav <82380971+ricktav@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-air2.dtsi | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-air2.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-air2.dtsi
index 9ee8b64f2..air2gpu 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-air2.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t7001-air2.dtsi
@@ -296,7 +296,11 @@
 			remote-endpoint = <&tristar_charger_usb>;
 		};
 	};
 };
 
+&gpu {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 /*
  * The BCM4350C2's Bluetooth on UART3, from the ADT uart3/bluetooth node:
-- 
2.50.1
